<H1>Motorcycle Ride From Yachats,OR back home October 08, 2021</H1>
<BR>
<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?mid=1Esl9OR8LwjFVlRXGoMJvOvDrXCbpyzZ6" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_hwy101_redwood_20211008.jpg" ALIGN=RIGHT style="width:592px"></A>
A playlist of all of <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL65CwO7O2fX_fx7gAzxt3hf1VTf3sGs9e" target="_blank">the videos from</A> the ride from October 2 thru October 8, 2021.
<BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR><BR>
Right out the back door of the nights lodgings was <a href="https://stateparks.oregon.gov/index.cfm?do=park.profile&parkId=89" target="_blank">Smelt Sands State Recreation Site</A> a beautiful <A HREF="https://www4.bing.com/maps?cp=44.324990~-124.105684&lvl=15&style=h" target="_blank">rocky beach</A> that later turned into a wide sandy beach. Classic Northwest Beach.
<BR><BR>
Partly sunny / cloudy start to the day:<BR>
<A HREF="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1K8_y0zltEDfHXhPhIKW-jGzeSIR59RSm/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_hwy101_redwood_20211008_1_smelt_sands_state_recreation_sm.jpg"></A>
<BR><BR>
Looking south:<BR>
<A HREF="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1u5vCY50L9P-h42lI3KluStH05wOOwk4U/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_hwy101_redwood_20211008_2_smelt_sands_state_recreation_sm.jpg"></A>
<BR><BR>
A little further north on the beach:<BR>
<A HREF="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1IPPWJrCw63OrMyDU9LlpWrdLVzfKhcJw/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_hwy101_redwood_20211008_3_smelt_sands_state_recreation_sm.jpg"></A>
<BR><BR>
Further north almost at the wide sandy part of the beach:<BR>
<A HREF="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gDdbWzOhAsQCh01FViYFwXV7EkQyEgYW/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><IMG SRC="Motorcycle/motorcycle_hwy101_redwood_20211008_4_smelt_sands_state_recreation_sm.jpg"></A>
<BR><BR>
The ride was MOSTLY dry, but some rain. Riding across the <a href="https://youtu.be/JB5p6wVOito" target="_blank">Astoria Megler Bridge again in this video</A> but this time heading north / east. The amazing Columbia river in view for this ride.
<BR><BR>
Home again, finally. An enjoyable trip just getting out and about.
<BR><BR>
